<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Happy New Year from Pay2View</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617, #020617);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ad-container {
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 90%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      padding: 28px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .ad-container::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px;
      right: -60px;
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #22c55e, transparent 70%);
      opacity: 0.15;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #020617;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #334155;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    ul li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #020617;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    ul li::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: #22c55e;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e, #16a34a);
      color: #020617;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 26px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .cta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.45);
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ad-container">

    <h2>Hello {{username }}</h2>
    <h2>🎉 Happy New Year from Pay2View</h2>

    <p>
      Thank you for being part of Pay2View.
      Last year, we successfully paid several customers,
      and we truly appreciate the trust you placed in us.
    </p>

    <p>
      As we move into the new year, our focus remains the same —
      more opportunities, more transparency,
      and more money made together.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Trusted platform</li>
      <li>Real payouts</li>
      <li>Growth in the new year</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="https://pay2view.com" class="cta" target="_blank">
      Thank You for Your Support
    </a>

    <div class="footer-note">
      Wishing you success and growth this year 🚀
      All right reverseved pay2view 2026
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
